  "about": [
    "What a log line becomes on its way into a ZIP of the logs, and how many replacements of each",
    "kind it takes, each line through a fresh redactor. Both redactors run every vector:",
    "DiagnosticLogRedactor (the diagnostic bundle, DiagnosticLogRedactorTest in Backend quality)",
    "and frontend/src-tauri/src/redact.rs (the Save logs ZIP, its tests in the Tauri (Rust) job),",
    "so a rule changed in one and not the other fails a build. The known misses are pinned too, so",
    "improving one is a decision to change both. apiKey is the session key each vector runs with."
